  "name": "WF4 — Checkout day cleaner reminder [FIXED + Annotated]",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "WF4: The \"Double-Check\" Escalation System\nHow it works:\n\nMorning Alert: At 8:00 AM, the system identifies a checkout and pings the cleaner. It simultaneously sets a \"Digital Alarm\" in Google Sheets by setting Awaiting Response to TRUE.\n\nThe Silent Listener (Bottom Branch): This workflow sits quietly in the background. As soon as the cleaner replies \"OK\", it instantly flips that Google Sheets status to FALSE.\n\nThe Escalation Check: After a 2-hour delay, the main workflow \"wakes up\" and checks the status of that Digital Alarm.\n\nIf FALSE: The system knows the cleaner responded. It does nothing and stops.\n\nIf TRUE: The system realizes the cleaner is silent. It triggers the Emergency Voice Call to ensure the apartment is cleaned before the next guest arrives at 3:00 PM.",
        "height": 256,
        "width": 832
      },
